 "beats": [
  {
   "line": "In this town, every time you laugh, a balloon pops out of your mouth.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 3.18
  },
  {
   "line": "A giggle makes one the size of a grape.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 1.54
  },
  {
   "line": "A real laugh makes one big enough to lift you off the floor.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 2.23
  },
  {
   "line": "Last year, our teacher laughed at her own joke and spent math class on the ceiling.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 3.18
  },
  {
   "line": "So nobody here laughs.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 1.2
  },
  {
   "line": "The cinema only shows documentaries.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 2.3
  },
  {
   "line": "Every classroom has a net.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 1.06
  },
  {
   "line": "And me? I'm the most serious kid in school.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 3.78
  },
  {
   "line": "I have not laughed in 3 years.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 1.24
  },
  {
   "line": "My little sister Pia laughs at everything.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 2.56
  },
  {
   "line": "Spoons. Pigeons. The word \"pudding.\"",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 1.9
  },
  {
   "line": "I pull her down by the ankle about 6 times a day.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 2.19
  },
  {
   "line": "Then, on Saturday, a pigeon stole a man's hat.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 2.26
  },
  {
   "line": "Pia laughed so hard she went up past the roofs and got stuck on top of the clock tower.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 3.27
  },
  {
   "line": "\"Our ladder is 60 feet,\" the fire chief said.",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 1.93
  },
  {
   "line": "\"She's at 200.\"",
   "style": "town",
   "scene": "balloons",
   "seconds": 0.75
  }
 ],
